<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  Stashless reference permission set. Import into each non-production IFS
  Cloud environment (Solution Manager, Users and Permissions, Permission
  Sets, Import), then grant it to the connector's service user. Every
  entity is read only and no actions are granted; the connector never
  writes. FrameworkServices is needed for the service update number.
  PsoIntegrationDatasets is needed for the PSO active dataset count.
  ApplicationMessagesHandling is needed for message timing; it reads queue,
  receiver, state and timestamps, never message content.
  PsoIntegrationDatasets includes the SchedulingConfig entity by IFS's
  design, but the projection exposes no entity set or function that returns
  it; PsoIntegrationConfiguration, which does, is deliberately not granted.
-->
